    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just so busy with work and the clinic is like a 45 min drive away. it doesnt feel that bad now just a bit throbbing. if i just scrub it really well with some antiseptic and maybe put some antibiotic ointment on it, would that be enough to stop anything bad from happening? i'm pretty sure i've had my shots before like years ago.",
